{"schema_version":1,"pipeline_version":"v6","run_id":"data-analysis-2026-02-02-20260202033902.-d4c9b600","generated_at":"2026-02-02T03:39:02.494Z","canonical_id":"huggingface:argmaxinc/whisperkit-coreml","promptHash":"sha256:7ef9f4826a6431ff4563a615474b7a60a8a63664de6976e4596f3863d9adc46b","summary_version":1,"status":"qualified","source":"huggingface","name":"whisperkit-coreml","url":"https://huggingface.co/argmaxinc/whisperkit-coreml","tags":["whisperkit","coreml","whisper","asr","quantized","automatic-speech-recognition","region:us"],"stats":{"downloads_total":1765986,"likes_total":158},"metadata":{"license":"N/A","lang":"N/A","categories":{"capabilities":[],"scenes":[],"lifecycle":[]}},"summary_short":{"zh":"WhisperKit-CoreML 是专为苹果 Core ML 框架优化的 Whisper 语音识别模型版本，解决了移动设备上离线语音转文字的性能瓶颈。其核心技术在于量化压缩技术，能在保持高准确率的同时大幅减小模型体积，让原本需要云端计算的大型语音模型能在 iPhone 和 Mac 上流畅运行。开发者可将其集成到 iOS/macOS 应用中，实现实时字幕生成、语音助手或无障碍功能，开源代码还允许调整量化参数以适应不同设备的性能需求，为移动端语音应用开发提供了实用解决方案。","en":"WhisperKit-CoreML is an optimized version of OpenAI's Whisper speech recognition model specifically converted for Apple's Core ML framework, enabling efficient on-device transcription without cloud dependency. Its technical innovation lies in quantization techniques that signifi…","es":"WhisperKit-CoreML is an optimized version of OpenAI's Whisper speech recognition model specifically converted for Apple's Core ML framework, enabling efficient on-device transcription without cloud dependency. Its technical innovation lies in quantization techniques that signifi…"},"summaries":{"en":"WhisperKit-CoreML is an optimized version of OpenAI's Whisper speech recognition model specifically converted for Apple's Core ML framework, enabling efficient on-device transcription without cloud dependency. Its technical innovation lies in quantization techniques that significantly reduce model size while maintaining accuracy, allowing large speech models to run smoothly on mobile devices. Developers can integrate it into iOS/macOS apps for real-time transcription, voice assistants, or accessibility features, with the open-source code providing opportunities to experiment with different quantization levels for specific hardware constraints.","zh":"WhisperKit-CoreML 是专为苹果 Core ML 框架优化的 Whisper 语音识别模型版本，解决了移动设备上离线语音转文字的性能瓶颈。其核心技术在于量化压缩技术，能在保持高准确率的同时大幅减小模型体积，让原本需要云端计算的大型语音模型能在 iPhone 和 Mac 上流畅运行。开发者可将其集成到 iOS/macOS 应用中，实现实时字幕生成、语音助手或无障碍功能，开源代码还允许调整量化参数以适应不同设备的性能需求，为移动端语音应用开发提供了实用解决方案。","es":"WhisperKit-CoreML is an optimized version of OpenAI's Whisper speech recognition model specifically converted for Apple's Core ML framework, enabling efficient on-device transcription without cloud dependency. Its technical innovation lies in quantization techniques that significantly reduce model size while maintaining accuracy, allowing large speech models to run smoothly on mobile devices. Developers can integrate it into iOS/macOS apps for real-time transcription, voice assistants, or accessibility features, with the open-source code providing opportunities to experiment with different quantization levels for specific hardware constraints."},"provider":{"name":"deepseek-tri","version":"1.0.0","mode":"json_single"},"quality":{"score":0.92,"fallback":false,"length":{"en":651,"zh":238,"es":651},"warnings":["es_short:0"],"accepted_at":"2026-02-02T03:34:22.989Z"}}
